{"title":"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many of the four integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155fa3807f26f4268430319bb47b97658353ad8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/7/f1720dd00c074c5117fd6ad8af607e2b4214bf38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/9/1f92f42ba38d4ef939f9de3c794b3fa9bd36d7a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22~222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/a/09a837befb5d48c75ee75c1ddec904b4619118dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222~222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" /> are multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/6/6b612f2e7d03d9dfcc6823d02741b0620b173593.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28slow.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(slow)\">Solution 1 (slow)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (slow)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can divide each number by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/3646bf0df41e1a65bb64ce854ad18922241ed404.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{222}{3} = 74$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" /> with no remainder, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155fa3807f26f4268430319bb47b97658353ad8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/9/119bea3994bd6d18491cd05d0622878c7bcab895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2222}{3} &gt; 740$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" /> with a remainder, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/7/f1720dd00c074c5117fd6ad8af607e2b4214bf38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/8842ee01d686211e31c98dac3e44ff4c709809a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$not$\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" /> divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/f/f4f81bafbab37ddfb2257f6e71821ba5389d0221.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{22~222}{3} &gt; 7407$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"117\" height=\"38\" /> with a remainder, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/9/1f92f42ba38d4ef939f9de3c794b3fa9bd36d7a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22~222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/8842ee01d686211e31c98dac3e44ff4c709809a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$not$\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" /> divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/5/e95886304aaf13b0ab639ed359b8f36756aac79b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{222~222}{3} = 74074$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" /> with no remainder, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/a/09a837befb5d48c75ee75c1ddec904b4619118dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222~222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/a/23a2f061f8f2df53490611b377187a253211b4b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" /> numbers that are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the fact that the sum of the digits must be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in order for the number to be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a832b76c4f4a4ec13ac1b557da4fed6006e64d00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> is the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155fa3807f26f4268430319bb47b97658353ad8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, which is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155fa3807f26f4268430319bb47b97658353ad8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/2/8d27141e139b95bfbd840f6102974a2545d6cbad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 4 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> is the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/7/f1720dd00c074c5117fd6ad8af607e2b4214bf38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/8842ee01d686211e31c98dac3e44ff4c709809a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$not$\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" /> divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/7/f1720dd00c074c5117fd6ad8af607e2b4214bf38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/8842ee01d686211e31c98dac3e44ff4c709809a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$not$\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" /> divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/3/d23a85adfbffb95303b87ed4e018c014afeef319.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 5 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" /> is the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/9/1f92f42ba38d4ef939f9de3c794b3fa9bd36d7a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22~222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/8842ee01d686211e31c98dac3e44ff4c709809a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$not$\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" /> divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/9/1f92f42ba38d4ef939f9de3c794b3fa9bd36d7a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22~222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/8842ee01d686211e31c98dac3e44ff4c709809a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$not$\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" /> divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c768058527b5b4d48df61c1a9147f1c5ddefb147.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 6 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> is the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/a/09a837befb5d48c75ee75c1ddec904b4619118dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222~222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" />, which is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/a/09a837befb5d48c75ee75c1ddec904b4619118dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222~222$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/a/23a2f061f8f2df53490611b377187a253211b4b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" /> numbers that are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley\">2013 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"CEMC Cayley\">CEMC Cayley</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232258\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.092 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 288/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2050/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 310/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8813/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.351      1 Template:CEMC_box\n100.00%    7.351      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35122:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232258 and revision id 272394. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}